Package: gflowx
Title: Experimental Extensions and Legacy Comparators for gflow
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Peter", "Gajer", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "pgajer@example.com")
    )
Description: Experimental and legacy geometric regression tools split out from
    gflow so that the core package can remain focused. The initial package
    provides bridge exports for rdgraph regression workflows while their native
    implementation is being extracted from gflow.
